<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.50 trln	 vs	    2.55 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  294.81		vs	  370.31</p>
<p> Current	     61.69		vs	  125.27</p>
<p> Net		   30.01		vs	   50.78</p>
